# Cloudflare Pages redirects
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/

# Legacy GitHub Pages subpath compatibility.
# Any /ymllblog/* request (e.g. from old links/bookmarks) → strip the prefix.
# Only safe to enable when Cloudflare Pages is the canonical host.
/ymllblog/*   /:splat   301

# Force HTTPS — Cloudflare already does this at the edge, but explicit is clearer.
# http://*:hostname/*  https://:hostname/:splat  301

# Trailing-slash normalization handled by Astro — no rule needed.